{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110406001:1":{"text":"気をつけろ。ここはあいつらの本拠地だ。","source_cn":"小心点。这里就是他们的老巢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A0F55A5A18F8CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110406002:1":{"text":"アルサ、もし手荒なことをされそうになったら、オレの後ろに隠れ――","source_cn":"阿尔萨，如果他们发难，就躲进我身后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80B55ABB7B3ADC4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110406003:1":{"text":"ソーン！よく帰ったな！それにアルサも！二人の武勇伝は砂漠中に知れ渡ってるぞ！","source_cn":"索恩，欢迎回归！还有阿尔萨！两位蛮血勇士的英名已经传遍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A5476B5E30D7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110406003":{"text":"ソーン！よく帰ったな！それにアルサも！二人の武勇伝は砂漠中に知れ渡ってるぞ！","source_cn":"索恩，欢迎回归！还有阿尔萨！两位蛮血勇士的英名已经传遍了沙漠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A5476B5E30D7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110406004:1":{"text":"どういうこと？連行されたのに、なんだか歓迎されてるような雰囲気だけど……","source_cn":"怎么回事？我们被押送过来，实在没想到还能享受这种待遇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3BA194A68D17B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110406005:1":{"text":"なんだって？連行？","source_cn":"什么？押送？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E192DAD5B69DBEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110406006:1":{"text":"このぼんくらどもがっ！俺は「お連れしろ」と言っただろう！","source_cn":"——你们这两个笨蛋，完全搞错了！我说的是“请”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04418DDDAF4FF89D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110406007:1":{"text":"試練で大活躍した期待の新星たちに、特にソーンに何てことしてくれてんだ！","source_cn":"对这样两位年少有为的著名勇者——尤其是索恩，怎能如此粗暴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91007F7AEA60EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110406008:0":{"text":"すまねぇ、兄貴！俺たちが間違ってやした！罰でも何でも受けやすんで！","source_cn":"对不起，大哥，我们错了。我下去自己领罚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE60F96BE7B3BAB73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110406009:1":{"text":"すまなかったな、ソーン！お前が帰ってきてみんな喜んでるんだよ！","source_cn":"索恩，真抱歉！其实你回到家来，整个氏族都很高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A72DE99D2EA489","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110406010:1":{"text":"帰